{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "47ec75e59ea95c6f0e9153ab26ba00d28bffd14f9b178b229c0d85ff17e64c90", "ja": "オトメ達のヒミツ", "zh": "少女们的秘密", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "82bb02329b387c77c852b2ac20775cded50c1314cddb0c1a9ba22c7753a3efe3", "ja": "仕事のため、早朝から歌織と風花を迎えに\n行くプロデューサー。だがこのみから、今は\nちょっと…と待たされる。その後、仕事先で\n朝の事を恥じる歌織。昨晩はプロデューサー\n話で盛り上がったと詳細を伏せて言われる。", "zh": "制作人一早为工作去接歌织与风花，\n但木实却说现在不太方便，请他稍等一会。\n之后，歌织在工作地点为早上的自己感到羞愧。\n她还告诉制作人昨晚大家热烈讨论著他，\n却没有告诉他详情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "d64029bc78e734a42e2295b41342ca316578cb07d8ee0763c10eb14422b5b023", "ja": "―ルームシェア開始から数日後―", "zh": "──共居生活开始几天后──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c4dd8636d1eea32032f5b27f2d495a1e15ec4fd37aeaec3212205a864f2ef621", "ja": "（さて、今日は歌織さんと風花のインストアライブだ！\nまだ朝早いが、麗花の家まで迎えに行くとしよう）", "zh": "（好，今天歌织小姐跟风花要举行店内演唱会！\n现在才大清早，但我还是去丽花家迎接她们吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1002_null", "source_sha256": "7f78a84b8557ac53d9ff6e854da209b95fb2e4dbc198975d0503c05e5a168acb", "ja": "ピンポーン！", "zh": "叮咚──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1227e8d55be20fe85875aa166a7ffa9781005fb760b7106591a2ad7118169f82", "ja": "歌織さーん、風花ー。\n迎えに来ました。", "zh": "歌织小姐～风花～\n我来接你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1004_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "5922d239c2b863f8af6880ff61cf1db021b54470e9ebc8caec56184ad2e7ee86", "ja": "{$P$}、おはよう……。", "zh": "{$P$}，早啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "019bc951ee6d3b0a805fbed3e2ed47a3cd60e092b2730a744faa1d2766915508", "ja": "あ、このみさん。おはようございます。\nずいぶんと眠そうですね。", "zh": "啊，木实，早安。\n你好像还很困。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "0223e25d637bd17129659cd274259a1140f1ed0220c87bb4d63b7579bda0baf1", "ja": "低血圧で、朝は弱いのよね……。それより、\n歌織ちゃんと風花ちゃんを迎えに来たのよね？", "zh": "我有低血压，早上爬不太起来……\n不说这个了，你是来接歌织跟风花的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c674be1ebf7faea33c1a0056aaf892851db4d92ba2337605f53e99ece0ad35b6", "ja": "そうなんです。ちょっと、\n家の中にお邪魔してもいいですか？", "zh": "是啊。\n我可以进屋打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "9c0acef0f45ff08204f549b18e2f7603f54204da62b646cf259c9bdf5bdd55f5", "ja": "それはダメよ！　今の歌織ちゃんはちょっと、\n見せられない格好だから！", "zh": "这可不行！\n歌织现在的样子不太能见人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4312dc6707551619546e780be30ade33a59a434204838a4a0a84af554b8fa897", "ja": "歌織さんが……？", "zh": "歌织小姐她……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3c8dad31ef3fda02fcb0d3e75159d47c4fc614b38f60bd65d5d0113b886c89e7", "ja": "か、歌織さん～！　そんな格好で、\n家を歩き回っちゃダメですよ～！", "zh": "歌、歌织～！\n不可以那样子在屋里到处乱走啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "e104476b4bd7efeddbbfb99d5fbb1ee66cc4021a46cc75654dd03daf688762be", "ja": "は～い……むにゃ……。", "zh": "好～的……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ff470a84f828ddd31bf9d70e931da0d47d21919b5a766d2812856995818d881f", "ja": "寝ぼけちゃってるんですか！？　起きて歌織さん！\nせめて上はちゃんとつけて……歌織さん～！", "zh": "你睡迷糊了吗！？醒醒啊歌织！\n至少把上衣穿好……歌织～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ae2d18521caedb18f3b732f426bfbb42ce0049d45f6a8f34de42f27f271008ac", "ja": "……すいません。\n聞かなかったことにします。", "zh": "……对不起。\n我会当作没听见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "902d3ce376831ab34a7278ba9bc445735bda461555001cc3a11ed67b7b0f6a8b", "ja": "そうね。忘れてあげて……。\n歌織ちゃんも、朝は全然ダメみたいなの。", "zh": "是啊，你就忘了吧……\n歌织好像也是早上完全起不来的类型。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "c237a12fbd373d6ec9808403b3fdea1a53ecb54b6a9911ff3899d91bbef8c97c", "ja": "というわけで、もうしばらく\n準備にかかりそうなんだけど……大丈夫かしら？", "zh": "所以啰，等她准备好似乎还要一点时间……\n没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1017_p", "source_sha256": "794dd2ddbce666e9be7099c0f570e12412d0d887201668bae70b013e53a1ea22", "ja": "平気ですよ、まだ時間はありますから。\nところで、麗花は？　大学の講義ですか？", "zh": "没问题，反正还有时间。\n对了，丽花呢？去大学上课吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "aaa465dad40868e6b9d75bed768e64d97d3fee4ea3a50a62e4b64424365e4a14", "ja": "ええ。今日は公園に出かけて、\nバードウォッチングをしてくるとか言ってたわね。", "zh": "对，她有说今天会外出到公园赏鸟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "470b0c7a850aa29b435f64b1f718f9d42d9224d4d7c579cc1c605ed71b2a9b79", "ja": "それはまた、面白そうな講義ですね。\n……講義でいいんですよね？", "zh": "这门课听起来还真是有趣。\n……确定她是去上课没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e50e16134345fb1cd46d36d2a97a1df05085d347dc1a6c744876e08d422f6a09", "ja": "（結局、歌織さんの支度には、\nそれから一時間ほどかかった……）", "zh": "（结果在那之后，\n歌织小姐花了一小时才准备好……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "2b335497f92180788040ef5e58be5faf03cb8cc15e6dedf8b0cd559a803cfb39", "ja": "あの……、本当にすみませんでした、\n{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "那个……真的很对不起，\n{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1cb4601183154ae15236a4ba529b31e59b23846ba6085a4c693788c92c8b3b9a", "ja": "いえ、仕事にはちゃんと間に合ったわけですから。\n気にしなくても大丈夫ですよ。", "zh": "没关系，反正有准时赶上工作时间，\n你就别放在心上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "321cba4c2f5ac5fa51f657093ac74b14bc9307db1e77a0f42064fbf7adbe0c84", "ja": "うう、誰かに起こしてもらわないとダメだなんて。\nもう大人なのに、恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "呜呜，居然还需要别人叫我起床。\n我都已经是个大人了，这样好丢脸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "390c532daa4d30564057cf58f12fa10355a71feabdcbf3af017b891d71b60592", "ja": "ふふっ、でも寝ぼけちゃってる歌織さん、\nちょっと可愛かったですよ♪", "zh": "呵呵，但是睡迷糊的歌织有点可爱喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1025_052kao", "source_sha256": "b3d20e568a3db36ac72c616f25aa1b0b10e032d4c3f7aa3acaee13a15fbd9bdb", "ja": "もう、やめて、風花ちゃんっ……。", "zh": "讨厌，别说了，风花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "ff375082529d926dcf8803fcc4611a066fc2ded5b437570a00fcc7418283ac93", "ja": "でも、そのせいなのかな。いつもの歌織さんと、\nちょっと雰囲気が違う気がするんですが……。", "zh": "不过，或许是因为这个关系吧。\n我觉得歌织小姐给人的感觉跟平常不太一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "24cb59d5de853ee2172983b22923443e8a2241fc4721e82afca46d54a5042d7c", "ja": "あ、それはきっと、私が風花ちゃんに\nいろいろお世話になったからだと思います。", "zh": "啊，我想那肯定是因为风花很照顾我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1028_p", "source_sha256": "ba018a0d9b1a831cb0b691373e6d614fdda03ccc169e96c853bc42834cc6354b", "ja": "お世話に……？", "zh": "照顾你……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "adc453fe19be836f9d4210f1e84c10a7a9bbcb5bafba7dd66f8cd7b7f03c0c1a", "ja": "はい、乳液も化粧水も風花ちゃんのですから。\nとっても肌になじんで……後で教えてね、風花ちゃん。", "zh": "对，因为乳液跟化妆水都是风花借我的。\n擦起来好快就吸收了……风花，之后再告诉我牌子喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c6de5cf9e51beb62f1dda002c7fbb1a37525a757ec9efb01a3c1e0dc72bd252b", "ja": "はい、おススメですよ♪　あ、乳液の方は、\n売ってるお店が少ないから要注意です！", "zh": "好的，那两罐保养品我都很推荐喔♪\n啊，有在卖那款乳液的店很少，要特别注意喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "56422fca3a8284cecc3c9a22e41c42e97301a58d1f92b91284cd2ac7ab63841b", "ja": "いろいろあるんですね……。もしかして、\n髪も風花に編んでもらったんですか？", "zh": "这些东西有很多门道呢……\n该不会，头发也是风花帮你绑的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1032_052kao", "source_sha256": "b3a12ab189ce13b385fbd24c9af5340745a3b2d0346774251e42f1566b57b43e", "ja": "あ、やっぱりわかりますか？　\nはい、今日は風花ちゃんに編んでもらいました♪", "zh": "啊，果然看得出来吗？\n没错，今天是风花帮我绑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c7a9d2b09f6db70685e7680d4f063e22aafd78b68e15bd6a1a94fb6d352dfb3e", "ja": "歌織さんの髪、すっごくサラサラなんですよ！\n羨ましいなぁ。私はくせっ毛だから……。", "zh": "歌织的头发非常柔顺喔！\n好羡慕啊，因为我是自然卷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1034_052kao", "source_sha256": "a1cd37e1c563828bab14f9433a94e85a9920a41087f5826e315d2ec02d1cccfe", "ja": "あら、風花ちゃんの髪だって、とっても素敵じゃ\nないかしら。ね、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "哎呀，风花的发型不是也非常漂亮吗？\n对吧，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_1035", "source_sha256": "a33967b3fe4d92e08113bb6ad7b15b47c8ffb5fa8f47144c1b5e5c56e5d51720", "ja": "もちろん", "zh": "当然", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2000_p", "source_sha256": "bf52d117dcbb8c534ebee387eff094a526f3038c98583bcccd5f03930bd449a1", "ja": "もちろんです。くせっ毛を上手に活かした、\n可愛い髪型ですよね。俺は好きだよ。", "zh": "当然啰，这发型完全利用自然卷的特性，\n打理得非常可爱，我很喜欢喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e64a38619997f5b3af2858ebe882b5b5ddf55b4d9b90caa886856f30afccc840", "ja": "えっ。……す、好き……あの、そんな風に思ってくれ\nてたんですか、{$P$}さん……？", "zh": "咦？……喜、喜欢……那个，\n{$P$}先生，你是这么认为的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2002_p", "source_sha256": "ed94bfee17c86f27b273fa54c1cab6d79ada2d1b9d54abda6e42b9995e22da0a", "ja": "ああ、風花の柔らかい雰囲気に、\nよく似合ってると思うな。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得很适合风花柔和的气质。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f53edc8cd0248e99d373c902c2398bafe3d7d8aa9707e9a56efac4e1f5908f14", "ja": "そ、そうですか。うれしいな……。\nありがとうございます♪", "zh": "是、是这样啊。\n真高兴……谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2004_p", "source_sha256": "0b9dcdc9cf73e38d5ea2ddb441014e8bbb36f6f9f341295fbb986f88171dbeb2", "ja": "それにしても、ルームシェアは\n上手くいってるみたいですね。", "zh": "话说回来，\n你们的共居生活似乎过得很顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2005_052kao", "source_sha256": "c6d14e6ec3a7208416a0540df60b68d57aae797b4c8cc2b8f0e4f908a2b2d78d", "ja": "あ、そうなんです！\nやっぱり一緒に住んでみると、全然違いますね。", "zh": "啊，没错！\n住在一起就是完全不一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2006_052kao", "source_sha256": "1e54fad87463de9bfcc0948c08589c28baebda09f2a2831054df19b92fe6cefe", "ja": "お話もたくさんできるし、何かこう……\nみんなのこと、すごく身近に感じます。", "zh": "不但可以聊很多事，还有一种……\n非常贴近大家的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3e07d4b523205c363201acd836ea4d03066bb959dc7def8ecee41726740d8438", "ja": "このみさんや麗花ちゃんとも、仲良くなりましたよね。\nルームシェア、やってみて本当に良かったです♪", "zh": "我们跟木实、丽花的感情也变好了呢。\n真的很庆幸我们有尝试共居♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2008_052kao", "source_sha256": "2621bdb2515ba1b65b48fac2ad6d78cbaa8e8bdf5652371e1931471369a37c8d", "ja": "そうそう、昨日も{$P$}さんの\nお話で、とっても盛り上がったんですよ？", "zh": "对了对了，昨天还聊到{$P$}先生，\n而且聊得非常热络呢，对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f54482f83c81687dd3ff4e289fb3e25ccb0a468bbca3dbd05c698e77ade3f82c", "ja": "か、歌織さん！　その話は絶対、\n絶対に内緒だって言ったじゃないですか～！", "zh": "歌、歌织！我们不是说好了，\n这件事绝对、绝对要对本人保密吗～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2010_052kao", "source_sha256": "311361931aa6ccaa5fd3e3f72be99d9de197274d0e7119f725d43741bc6833f3", "ja": "あっ！　そうよね！　す、すみません、\n{$P$}さん、今のは忘れてください！", "zh": "啊！我忘记了！对、对不起，\n{$P$}先生，请忘掉我刚才说的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2011_p", "source_sha256": "9059ad4c8c8d8e1a70053b2d6cb64d414d4588a9ebd8919dd27777812739ac32", "ja": "わ、わかりました。\n努力はしてみます……。", "zh": "我、我知道了。\n我会努力忘记……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2012_p", "source_sha256": "76dd519160ee2b6bbf5bd16d40e1fe382af8ac7c231c26d111350eb2160e5022", "ja": "ちなみに、方向性だけでも、\n教えてもらうわけには……？", "zh": "顺带问一下，\n不能至少告诉我讨论的大方向吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "740f74757c88b1f4cb4627fea12218276ca508e8f97bf18fa0e4b605d6468d70", "ja": "あっ、そろそろイベントの時間です！　それじゃ、\n{$P$}さん、行ってきます！", "zh": "啊，活动差不多要开始了！\n那么，{$P$}先生，我上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2014_052kao", "source_sha256": "482613265508f318b9cbb0e1a75848fb739a80251843aaf51e8ee7bd02c19bef", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}さん。\n行ってきます！", "zh": "不好意思，{$P$}先生。\n我上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_03_2016_p", "source_sha256": "0fd40b09826a8481c95d95b4ff927f950ce28475d4269bdf7e6651de79f21a04", "ja": "（その日一日、ちょっぴりモヤモヤしながら過ごした。\nまあ、知らない方がいいこともある……のかな）", "zh": "（结果那天，我一整天都觉得心里有个疙瘩。\n算了，有些事情不知道比较好……应该吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
